      "blurb": "Elite Council Spectre - autonomous operative, extreme threat",
      "publicNotes": "<p>A turian Spectre is what happens when decades of military discipline intersect with covert operations training and the institutional authorization to do whatever is necessary. They operate without oversight, carry weapons and equipment restricted to standing military forces, and have contingency plans for situations most operatives would categorize as unwinnable.</p><p><strong>Formation Fighter:</strong> +1 circumstance to attacks and AC when adjacent to any ally.</p><p><strong>Hierarchy Command:</strong> Once per round as a free action, grants one ally within 30 ft a +1 circ. bonus to their next roll before the start of the Spectre's next turn.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 100 Shield HP. Recharges 10 HP per turn.</p>",
